    "original_instruction": "Great news! Our lead Marcus Johnson from DataFlow Systems is ready to move forward.\n\nPlease:\n1. Find Marcus Johnson in the CRM\n2. Convert him from a lead to a contact and account\n3. Post a message in the #sales channel on Slack that includes \"lead converted\" and mentions \"Marcus Johnson\"",
